{emailSubject}Password Recovery Request - {$username}{/emailSubject}
<h1>User {$username} has requested a password reset</h1>

<p>You can reset your password by following this link:</p>

{button($link, 'Reset the password')|noescape}

<p>
    This link will allow you to change your password until <strong>{$expiresAfter}</strong>.
    After that, you will have to request a new link in the web application.
</p>

{linkFallback($link, 'If the button does not work, open this address:')|noescape}

<p class="quiet">
    If you did not request a password reset in {$siteName}, please ignore this email.
</p>
